{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"椭圆算子"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"椭圆算子"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"线性微分算子","text":"线性微分算子"}},{"Plain":" $D\\colon \\Gamma(E)\\to \\Gamma(F)$, 若其"},{"Local":{"url":"象征","text":"象征"}},{"Plain":" $\\sigma(D)(w)\\colon E_p\\to F_p$ 为同构, 则称 $D$ 为椭圆算子.</p>\n<p>椭圆算子的推广是"},{"Local":{"url":"椭圆复形","text":"椭圆复形"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}